# EDINET v2 subscription key.
#
# Get one free at https://api.edinet-fsa.go.jp/ :
#   1. 「アカウント作成」, confirm the email
#   2. sign in, open 「API キー発行」
#   3. copy the Subscription-Key into a .env next to this file
#
# The key is only ever read by scripts/fetch-edinet.ts, which runs on your
# machine at build time. It is never bundled and never reaches the browser -
# EDINET sends no CORS headers, so the browser could not call it in any case.
#
# Without a key the app runs on the committed fallback corpus and says so.
EDINET_API_KEY=
